# Vendored code: not ours to review.
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses these files by default in pull-request diffs and
# keeps them out of the repository's language statistics. They are still tracked
# and still built — the STM32CubeMX export in particular is deliberately committed
# rather than generated at build time (see 11 Decisions & As-Built, DEC-012).
#
# Without this, the CubeMX HAL export alone is 112 files and ~179k added lines,
# which buries the 30-odd files a reviewer actually needs to look at and pushes the
# diff past GitHub's 20k-line rendering limit.
Firmware/ThirdParty/** linguist-generated=true
